# ⚡ Crypto Scalping Bot

![Banner](images/bot-banner.png)

A fast and intelligent crypto trading bot that uses **Fair Value Gaps (FVG)** and **RSI** for 15-minute scalping.

## 🚀 Features

- ✅ FVG detection and confirmation logic
- ✅ RSI filtering to improve trade accuracy
- ✅ Auto trade execution via Binance API
- ✅ Clean logging and optional GUI with tkinter

